<title>USA: Box Energy buys stake in 6 Texas fields.</title>
<headline>Box Energy buys stake in 6 Texas fields.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Box Energy Corp said Thursday it is purchasing  a stake in six onshore Texas fields from Smith Production Co for an  undisclosed price.</p>
<p>The company did say the estimated reserves for Box's interest in the  six fields are in excess of its 1996 production of 2.3 million barrels  of oil equivalent with a price of about $5 per barrel of oil equivalent.</p>
<p>Box said additional working interest and geophysical options are being  negotiated. Smith will maintain a working interest in each of the  fields and remain as operator.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
